==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 4~16 seconds<sup>120f~480f</sup>.
*100 [[Snache]]s spawn after 10.67 seconds<sup>320f</sup>, delay 13.33~40 seconds<sup>400f~1,200f</sup>.
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*2 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*4 [[Kang Roo]]s (200%) spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bears Be Bare]] spawns as the boss.
**200 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 2.67~5.33 seconds<sup>80f~160f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**3 [[Kang Roo]]s (300%) spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use meatshields to protect your [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|area attackers]] (such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] and [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]]) while they deal with the Kang Roos, St. Pigges and Audience Bears. If you have [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], using him will make dealing with the Audience Bears a lot easier.

==Trivia==
*If one were to take a "B" and stick "ears" on the end of it, the result would be "Bears".

